			<set_collection>True</set_collection>
			<collection_index>0</collection_index>
			<text>Collection of scholarly papers to be analysed with the Semantico toolchain (literature classification and analysis workflow). The dataset is a structured, curated list in which each row describes exactly one paper with three columns: Author — the author(s) of the paper as given in the publication; Publication Date — the date (year, or full date when known) the paper was published; Title — the full title of the paper. The list is maintained by the project team through literature search and constitutes the input corpus of the analysis.</text>
